    "family_reading": {
        "text": "Meta Muse spans 6 versions, all supporting reasoning, with context windows from 131072 to 1048576 tokens. Only 1 of the 6 publishes open weights, so most of the line is API only. Inputs cover file, image, text and video, and output is text. The Spark tiers reach 1048576 tokens of context and 943718 tokens of output, suited to very long documents or large codebases. Contributor versions cost $0.1 per million input and $0.2 output, while standard Spark versions cost $1.25 and $4.25, so heavy use of the standard tier is costly. Muse Glimmer 30B is the open weights option, but its 131072 token context and 117964 token output are far smaller. Choose by budget and whether open weights matter.",
